{"strongs": "H0535", "word": "אָמַל", "translit": "a.mal", "root": "אמל", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "be weak, languish", "definition": "[ אָמַל ] verb be weak, languish (compare Arabic hope, expect ). Qal Participle passive feminine מָה אֲמֻלָה לִכָּתֵךְ how weak is thy heart! Ezek 16:30 (but < Co מַהלִּֿי וְלִבְרִיתֵח ); Pu`lal Perfect אֻמְלַל Joel 1:10 +; אֻמְלְלָה Isa 33:9 +; אֻמְלְלוּ Jer 14:2 etc.; — be or grow feeble, languish ; of loss of fertility (woman) 1Sam 2:5 ; Jer 15:19 of fisherman whose trade fails Isa 19:8 || אנה , אבל ); in genl. of inhabitants of smitten land Hos 4:3 (|| תֶּאֱבַל הָאָרֶץ ); Isa 24:4 compare below usually subject inanimate, personified; שַׁדְמוֺת חֶשְׁבּוֺן Isa 16:8 compare Nah 1:4 (twice in verse); תֵּבֵל Isa 24:4 (|| נבל , אבל ); אֶרֶץ Isa 33:9 (|| אבל ); subject גֶּפֶן Isa 24:7 (|| אָבַל תִּירוֺשׁ ; יִצְּהָר Joel 1:10 (|| שׁדד , אבל , הובישׁ ; kindred subject); תְּאֵנָה v Joel 1:12 (|| הַגֶּפֶן הוֺבִישָׁה ); שְׁעָרִים Jer 14:2 (|| אָֽבְלָה יְהוּדָה ); compare Lam 2:8 וַיַּאֲבֶלחֵֿל וְחוֺמָה יַחְדָּו אֻמְלָ֑לוּ .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB516')\">BDB516</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H535')\">H535</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB515')\">BDB515</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB517')\">BDB517</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>אָמַל</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>be weak, languish</highlightword> (compare Arabic <placeholder263/> <highlight>hope, expect</highlight>). <b>Qal</b> <highlight>Participle</highlight> passive feminine <bdbheb>מָה אֲמֻלָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>לִכָּתֵךְ</bdbheb> <highlight>how weak is thy heart!</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:30\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,30)\">Ezek 16:30</ref> (but &lt; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> <bdbheb>מַהלִּֿי וְלִבְרִיתֵח</bdbheb>); <b>Pu`lal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>אֻמְלַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Joel 1:10\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(29,1,10)\">Joel 1:10</ref> +; <bdbheb>אֻמְלְלָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 33:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,9)\">Isa 33:9</ref> +; <bdbheb>אֻמְלְלוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 14:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,14,2)\">Jer 14:2</ref> etc.; — <highlight>be</highlight> or <highlight>grow feeble, languish</highlight>; of loss of fertility (woman) <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,5)\">1Sam 2:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 15:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,15,19)\">Jer 15:19</ref> of fisherman whose trade fails <ref ref=\"Isa 19:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,19,8)\">Isa 19:8</ref> || <bdbheb>אנה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>אבל</bdbheb>); in genl. of inhabitants of smitten land <ref ref=\"Hos 4:3\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(28,4,3)\">Hos 4:3</ref> (|| <bdbheb>תֶּאֱבַל הָאָרֶץ</bdbheb>); <ref ref=\"Isa 24:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,24,4)\">Isa 24:4</ref> compare below usually subject inanimate, personified; <bdbheb>שַׁדְמוֺת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>חֶשְׁבּוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 16:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,16,8)\">Isa 16:8</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Nah 1:4\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(34,1,4)\">Nah 1:4</ref> (twice in verse); <bdbheb>תֵּבֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 24:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,24,4)\">Isa 24:4</ref> (|| <bdbheb>נבל</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>אבל</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>אֶרֶץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 33:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,9)\">Isa 33:9</ref> (|| <bdbheb>אבל</